# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Rust build artifacts
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# IDE
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Documentation
**/*.md
**/docs/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/

# Temporary files
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.tmp

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Test files (benches needed for Cargo.toml parsing)
**/tests/

# Coverage and profiling
**/coverage/
**/*.gcov
**/*.gcno
**/*.gcda
**/*.prof
**/perf.data*

# Infrastructure data directories
infra/custom/fs/

# Docker files (not needed inside build)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore
